<sect1 id="UdpDelaySimRunner_8h_1DESCRIPTION">
<title>DESCRIPTION</title>
<para>This <ref refid="classLtpRandomNumberGenerator" kindref="compound">LtpRandomNumberGenerator</ref> class defines methods for generating either 32 or 64 bit random numbers for LTP session numbers or LTP serial numbers using up to 3 sources of hardware randomness and birthday paradox prevention. These sources of randomness include microsecond time, boost::random_device, and optional x86 RDSEED instruction. </para>
</sect1>
